### Phase 6: Particle System & Animation Upgrades — 21st.dev-Inspired Effects

Upgrade the existing particle system and add new 21st.dev-inspired effects throughout.

#### [MODIFY] [ParticleBackground.jsx](file:///c:/Users/91986/OneDrive/Pictures/web3task/frontend/src/components/ParticleBackground.jsx)

- Particles become **small pixel squares** instead of circles
- Add **connection lines** between nearby particles (constellation effect — classic 21st.dev)
- Mouse-reactive: particles gently push away from cursor
- Color palette matches the neon theme (purple, cyan, pink, gold)
- Performance: requestAnimationFrame with delta-time, cap at 60fps

#### [MODIFY] [Confetti.jsx](file:///c:/Users/91986/OneDrive/Pictures/web3task/frontend/src/components/Confetti.jsx)

- Confetti pieces become **pixel squares and rectangles** (not rounded)
- Add rotation and physics (gravity + slight horizontal drift)
- Add a brief **screen flash** effect on trigger (white overlay, 100ms)
- Burst originates from the center of the correct guess message

#### [NEW] New CSS Animations in [index.css](file:///c:/Users/91986/OneDrive/Pictures/web3task/frontend/src/index.css)

Add the following 21st.dev-inspired animation utilities:
- `@keyframes pixelFadeIn` — elements materialize pixel-by-pixel
- `@keyframes glowPulse` — breathing neon glow on borders/text
- `@keyframes float` — gentle up-down hovering (for title, icons)
- `@keyframes shakeWarn` — screen shake for timer warning
- `@keyframes countUp` — for animated score counter effect
- `@keyframes scanline` — CRT scanline effect overlay
- `@keyframes borderGlow` — animated border that cycles through colors
- `@keyframes typewriter` — for "choosing a word..." text

